# libredwg_memory_cancel.patch - QuickView overlay patches for LibreDWG v0.13.4
#
# 1. New exported dwg_read_memory(buffer, size, dwg): decodes DWG read-only
#    in place (no copy), or DXF via an internal 0-terminated scratch copy,
#    mirroring dwg_read_file/dxf_read_file minus all stdio.  User hooks set
#    on Dwg_Data (cancel_check/progress/hook_ctx) survive the reset.
# 2. Cancel/progress checkpoints in the decode.c object loops (R13-R2000 and
#    R2004) and in in_dxf.c new_object (single funnel for all DXF objects).
#    cancel_check != 0 aborts with the new fatal DWG_ERR_CANCELLED; NULL
#    hooks keep upstream behaviour identical.
